# The saved customization patches must keep LF endings in the working tree.
# Checkouts here run with core.autocrlf=true, and a CRLF patch does not apply:
# `git am` would try to match CR-terminated context lines against LF sources and
# fail on every hunk. The blob is already LF; this stops the smudge on checkout.
customizations/*.patch text eol=lf
